Usage:
  plumber [command]

Available Commands:
  analyze       Analyze the CI/CD configuration of a GitHub or GitLab repository
  capabilities  Inspect the pipeline capabilities the CLI recognizes
  catalog       Print the control and issue catalog as JSON
  completion    Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config        Manage Plumber configuration
  explain       Show detailed information about a Plumber issue code or an attack path
  help          Help about any command
  version       Print the version information

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for plumber
  -v, --verbose   Enable debug logging on stderr (level=debug); replaces the progress bar

Use "plumber [command] --help" for more information about a command.

